nation: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (<a href=\"mailto:syjeong0531@chungbuk.ac.kr\">syjeong0531@chungbuk.ac.kr</a>)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">로 발송</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-LEFT: 13.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">제출 후 꼭 전화로 확인요망</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-LEFT: 13.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">8. 프레젠테이션 주제 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">아래 주제 중 택 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-LEFT: 18.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">당신의 삶을 더욱 행복하게</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">! </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">행복한 삶을 위한 제안</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">한국의 영어교육제도 발전을 위한 당신의 의견 및 제안</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대학생들이 자신의 재정상황 극복을 위한 노력</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">저축 및 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 돈 관리를 위한 당신의 제안</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">한국에서 미성년자 대상 성형수술은 금지되어져야 하는지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 에 대한 제안</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;5) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">스마트폰 사용량 증가에 따른 한국인의 삶에 영향</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 6) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">한국 스포츠의 미래 및 한국인의 스포츠와 운동 습관 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">★ 자세한 내용은 첨부파일 참조 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
